---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber off
    actor Steward
    participant Form as New SIR page<br/>new-report/page.tsx,<br/>UploadImages.tsx
    participant Presign as Presign route<br/>/api/s3/presign
    participant S3 as AWS S3
    participant Actions as Server actions<br/>utils/supabase/queries.ts
    participant DB as Supabase<br/>PostgreSQL

    Note over Steward,DB: Covers US 4.0.6. The photo upload flow exists. Today the Identifier is required in three places:<br/>the "*" mark in UploadImages.tsx, the checks in new-report/page.tsx and the metadata check in /api/s3/presign.<br/>"(proposed)" = the step is not in the code today.

    Steward->>Form: Open a new SIR and add a photo
    activate Form
    Form-->>Steward: Show the photo fields. The Identifier label has<br/>no "required" mark (AT 2) (proposed)
    Steward->>Form: Fill caption, photographer and date. Leave Identifier empty. Select Submit
    Form->>Form: Check required answers and photo fields.<br/>Identifier is not in the required list (proposed)
    alt A required field is empty or not in a valid format
        Form-->>Steward: Block submit. List the missing fields
    else All required fields are filled in a valid format
        opt Identifier is given
            Form->>Form: Check the limit of 20 characters (exists)
        end
        Form->>Actions: addSiteInspectionReport (exists)
        activate Actions
        Actions->>DB: Insert W26_form_responses row
        DB-->>Actions: responseId
        Actions-->>Form: responseId
        deactivate Actions
        Form->>Presign: POST file details with an empty identifier (exists)
        activate Presign
        Presign->>Presign: getUser() from the session (exists)
        Presign->>Presign: Check metadata. Identifier is optional (proposed).<br/>generateFilename leaves out the identifier part when it is empty (proposed)
        Presign-->>Form: Presigned PUT URL and key
        deactivate Presign
        Form->>S3: PUT the photo (exists)
        Form->>Actions: uploadSiteInspectionAnswers, insertInspectionAttachments<br/>with identifier NULL (exists)
        activate Actions
        Actions->>DB: Insert W26_answers and W26_attachments rows.<br/>W26_attachments.identifier can be NULL (exists)
        alt An upload or insert fails
            Actions-->>Form: Error
            Form->>Actions: rollbackSiteInspectionSubmission(responseId) (exists)
            Form-->>Steward: Show error. SIR is not saved
        else All steps pass
            Actions-->>Form: OK
            Form-->>Steward: Go to /sites?submitted=true. The SIR is saved (AT 1)
        end
        deactivate Actions
    end
    deactivate Form

    Note over Steward,DB: The edit page edit-report/[responseId]/page.tsx has the same Identifier check.<br/>It must change the same way, so that an edit with an empty Identifier is not blocked.
